RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H1_0::
	.string "Don't take us GYM TRAINERS lightly!\n"
	.string "I'll show you why we're better!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H1_1::
	.string "You were too good for me…$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H1_2::
	.string "You haven't seen anything of the\n"
	.string "ROCK type's terrifying power!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H2_0::
	.string "If you can't beat me, you won't\n"
	.string "stand a chance against ROXANNE!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H2_1::
	.string "Wow! You've got some potential!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H2_2::
	.string "ROXANNE is stronger than me by\n"
	.string "several times.\p"
	.string "You'd better be on your guard!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H3::
	.string "Yo, how's it going?\p"
	.string "Listen, my friend! Would you like to\n"
	.string "become the CHAMPION?\p"
	.string "I'm no TRAINER, not me, but I can\n"
	.string "sure give you winning advice.\p"
	.string "That's settled, then! We'll aim for\n"
	.string "the POKéMON CHAMPIONSHIP together!\p"
	.string "It's your job as a TRAINER to\n"
	.string "collect GYM BADGES, am I right?\p"
	.string "But GYM LEADERS aren't pushovers!\p"
	.string "And that's where I come in!\n"
	.string "I'm here to provide expert advice!\p"
	.string "ROXANNE, the GYM LEADER, is a user\n"
	.string "of ROCK-type POKéMON.\p"
	.string "The ROCK type is very durable, but\n"
	.string "it can't stand WATER-type and\l"
	.string "GRASS-type moves.\p"
	.string "Come see me afterwards, if you beat\n"
	.string "the GYM LEADER.\p"
	.string "Well, go for it!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H4_0::
	.string "We might be in the middle of town,\n"
	.string "but so what?\p"
	.string "My ROCK POKéMON need room to\n"
	.string "rampage!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H4_1::
	.string "Oh, man oh man! Our challenger is\n"
	.string "one feisty customer!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H4_2::
	.string "I have to hand it to our LEADER.\p"
	.string "It took smarts and sense for her to\n"
	.string "pick the ROCK type at her young\l"
	.string "age.$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H0_0::
	.string "A CHAMPION from KANTO? Welcome.\p"
	.string "I am ROXANNE. My students say a\n"
	.string "battle teaches more than a book.\p"
	.string "Then let us put that to the test.\n"
	.string "Show me how you read a battle!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H0_1::
	.string "A sound strategy, tested in battle.\n"
	.string "I still have much to learn.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H0_2::
	.string "A type chart is a starting point.\n"
	.string "What you do with it is your own.\p"
	.string "I will have a new lesson for my\n"
	.string "students tomorrow.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedStoneBadge::
	.string "Your victory earns the STONE BADGE.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} received the STONE BADGE\n"
	.string "from ROXANNE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
	.string "The keeper at SLATEPORT's harbor\n"
	.string "will add it to your HOENN record.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TakeTM39::
	.string "Take TM39 as well. A practical\n"
	.string "lesson to carry with you.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39::
	.string "{PLAYER} received TM39\n"
	.string "from ROXANNE!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39::
	.string "ROCK TOMB lowers the foe's SPEED.\n"
	.string "Control the pace, and a slow\l"
	.string "POKéMON can take the next move.\p"
	.string "A TM can only be used once.\n"
	.string "Choose its student carefully.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_NoRoomForTM39::
	.string "You cannot carry another TM39.\n"
	.string "I will keep it until you have room.\p"
	.string "Your STONE BADGE is already yours.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_Pikachu::
	.string "You brought PIKACHU to a ROCK GYM.\n"
	.string "That takes some nerve.\p"
	.string "GOLEM's GROUND type blocks its\n"
	.string "electricity. NOSEPASS can aim\l"
	.string "ZAP CANNON with LOCK-ON.\p"
	.string "Yet a battle is more than a list\n"
	.string "of types. You have shown me that.$"
@ END PATCH
